## Next Steps

To enable analytics in the Vercel dashboard:
1. Deploy this application to Vercel
2. Navigate to your project settings in Vercel dashboard
3. Go to Analytics section
4. Click "Enable Web Analytics"
5. Deploy the application again
6. Visit your site to generate traffic
7. View analytics data in the Vercel dashboard

